#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"With \"Start Minimized\" and \"Fullscreen\" this is the classic cast-target "
"setup: the app waits out of the way, plays fullscreen when something casts "
"to it, and goes back to waiting when the video ends or you press Q."
msgstr ""
"Amb \"Inicia minimitzat\" i \"Pantalla completa\", aquesta és la "
"configuració clàssica de l'objectiu de transmissió: l'aplicació espera, "
"reprodueix a pantalla completa quan alguna cosa s'hi transmet i torna a "
"esperar quan el vídeo acaba o pitgeu Q."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave these blank unless downloads are waking your disks too often. Set both "
"of the first two together: episodes are then fetched in one batch when a "
"series runs low, instead of one at a time."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"An episode's thumbnail is a frame of an episode you may not have watched yet."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off gives MPV's own mouse behaviour instead: drag the video to move the "
"window, and right click to pause. Double click is full screen either way."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off by default because some graphics drivers handle it badly. \"Only above "
"1080p\" is the cautious way to turn it on: most hardware decodes 1080p in "
"software without help. \"Copy (advanced)\" is slower, but it is the mode "
"that works with video filters, so it is the one to pick if you run SVP or "
"another VapourSynth filter. If video stops working, start with --disable-"
"hwdec and change this back."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Off means command-line mode: no window, no system tray and no settings "
"screen, so the only way back is editing conf.json by hand. It is not how you "
"get MPV's own on-screen controls — \"Player Controls Style\" under Interface "
"does that."
msgstr ""
"Desactivat significa mode de línia d'ordres: sense finestra, sense safata "
"del sistema i sense pantalla de configuració, de manera que l'única manera "
"de tornar enrere és editar conf.json manualment. No és com s'obtenen els "
"controls en pantalla propis de MPV: això ho fa l'\"Estil dels controls del "
"reproductor\" de la interfície."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Show only what is cast to this machine — the library, including this "
"settings screen, can't be reached from here. Without a system tray icon the "
"only way back is editing conf.json. For the classic cast-target setup you "
"want the Interface settings instead; this is for a shared TV nobody should "
"be able to browse from."
msgstr ""
"Mostra només el que s'ha emès a aquesta màquina; no es pot accedir des "
"d'aquí a la biblioteca, inclosa aquesta pantalla de configuració. Sense una "
"icona de la safata del sistema, l'única manera de tornar enrere és editar "
"conf.json. Per a la configuració clàssica de destinació de emissió, voleu la "
"configuració de la interfície; això és per a un televisor compartit des del "
"qual ningú no hauria de poder navegar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Some desktops — GNOME on Wayland in particular — draw no title bar on the "
"player window, leaving no way to move or close it. This puts minimize, "
"maximize and close in the top bar instead, and lets you drag the window by "
"it. Left on \"Only when the window has no title bar\", MPV is asked whether "
"this window got one, so desktops that do decorate it are left alone."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Requires restart to change. MPV keybinds are used by default. Press ENTER to "
"drive the player controls by keyboard. \"No player controls\" leaves "
"playback bare; the library, the keyboard shortcuts and the menu key still "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Cal reiniciar per a canviar. Per defecte, s'utilitzen les combinacions de "
"tecles MPV. Pitgeu RETORN per a controlar el reproductor mitjançant el "
"teclat. \"Sense controls del reproductor\" deixa la reproducció inútil; la "
"mediateca, les dreceres de teclat i la tecla de menú encara funcionen."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Pixels one wheel notch scrolls. On a grid this is rounded so a whole number "
"of notches spans one row, whichever scroll mode you are in — a trackpad or "
"trackball never leaves you a sliver of a row off. Raise it to scroll faster, "
"lower it for finer control."
msgstr ""
"Pixels, una roda amb osques de desplaçament. En una quadrícula, això "
"s'arrodonirà de manera que un nombre sencer d'osques abastarà una fila, "
"independentment del mode de desplaçament en què us trobeu: un trackpad o una "
"trackball mai us deixarà ni una mica fora de la fila. Pugeu-lo per desplaçar-"
"vos més ràpidament, baixeu-lo per a un control més precís."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Continuous\" scrolls by pixels and lands wherever the wheel puts it; it "
"lines rows up by itself if the display cannot keep up. Pick \"Aligned to "
"rows\" if scrolling still stutters — on a very large display, a slow or "
"remote one, or with an external MPV. Pick \"One row per notch\" to move a "
"whole row (or one home-screen section) at a time."
msgstr ""
"\"Continu\" es desplaça per píxels i aterra allà on la posi la roda; alinea "
"les files per si sola si la pantalla no pot seguir el ritme. Trieu \"Alineat "
"amb les files\" si el desplaçament encara falla — en una pantalla molt gran, "
"una de lenta o remota o amb un MPV extern. Trieu \"Una fila per osca\" per "
"moure una fila sencera (o una secció de la pantalla d'inici) alhora."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid "Discord Rich Presence. Takes effect after a restart."
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence. Té efecte després de reiniciar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Leave this to Default unless setting up passthrough. Note some audio servers "
"like Pipewire don't like passthrough and will need to be disabled for a card "
"before it'll let *any* audio through in passthrough mode. In my tests I got "
"silence otherwise, but results may vary."
msgstr ""
"Deixeu-ho per defecte tret que configureu el passthrough. Tingueu en compte "
"que alguns servidors d'àudio com Pipewire no són compatibles amb el "
"passthrough i s'hauran de desactivar per a una targeta abans que permeti el "
"pas de *qualsevol* àudio en mode passthrough. A les proves es va obtenir "
"silenci, però els resultats poden variar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Stop anything else using the device while playing. Needed for passthrough on "
"some systems, and it means other applications will be silent."
msgstr ""
"Atura qualsevol altra cosa que utilitzi el dispositiu mentre jugueu. "
"Necessari per al passthrough en alguns sistemes i això significa que altres "
"aplicacions restaran en silenci."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Page the library and music tile grids instead of scrolling: each page is one "
"screenful with First / Previous / Next / Last controls and a page number you "
"can type into. Easier than precise scrolling on a trackpad."
msgstr ""
"Moveu-vos a través de pàgines en la mediateca i la graella de música, en "
"comptes de lliscar: cada pàgina ocupa una pantalla completa amb els controls "
"Primer / Anterior / Següent / Darrer , a més d'un número de pàgina que podeu "
"teclejar. És més fàcil que lliscar amb precisió pel trackpad."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Channel logos come as ink on a transparent background, drawn for the white "
"page other clients put them on — so on a dark one the black ones vanish. On, "
"they are backed with the light plate they were made for, and the few whose "
"own outline is white get a drop shadow so they still have an edge against "
"it. Off, they get the theme's card colour and no shadows, as Jellyfin Web "
"does."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The same treatment for a library set to draw Logo artwork. Off by default, "
"because a film's or series' logo is white by convention and already reads on "
"a dark background — the plate is what makes it need a shadow. Turn it on if "
"yours are dark."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Palette, glow, cover style and default cover size. Colours change "
"immediately; cover and heading sizes take effect after a restart."
msgstr ""
"Paleta, resplendor, estil i mida de portada per defecte. Els colors canvien "
"immediatament; les mides de les portades i els encapçalaments tenen efecte "
"després de reiniciar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Overrides the theme's cover size. Applies immediately, and is also on the "
"View menu of any library."
msgstr ""
"Substitueix la mida de portada del tema. S'aplica immediatament i també es "
"troba al menú Visualització de qualsevol mediateca."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"The controls have to stay legible over any frame. \"None\" gives the text a "
"drop shadow instead of shading the picture behind it."
msgstr ""
"Els controls han de romandre llegibles en qualsevol fotograma. \"Cap\" "
"proporciona una ombra paral·lela al text en comptes d'ombrejar la imatge que "
"hi ha darrere."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Hide unless hovered\" keeps them up only while the pointer is on them, "
"paused or not."
msgstr ""
"\"Amaga tret que es mogui el cursor per sobre\" els manté actius només quan "
"el punter hi és a sobre, estiguin o no en pausa ."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"0 hides them as soon as the pointer is not on them, and forces \"Hide unless "
"hovered\"."
msgstr ""
"0 els amaga tan bon punt el punter no hi és a sobre i força \"Amaga tret que "
"es mogui el cursor per sobre\"."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"During playback only — in the library those buttons stay Back and Forward. "
"Off by default because they are easy to hit by accident on some mice. Takes "
"effect after a restart."
msgstr ""
"Només durant la reproducció — a la biblioteca es queden els botons Endavant "
"i Enrere. Desactivats per defecte perquè en alguns ratolins és fàcil pitjar-"
"los per accident. Té efecte després de reiniciar."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Takes effect after a restart. \"Follow display\" uses the scale your desktop "
"reports, which is 100% on X11."
msgstr ""
"Té efecte després de reiniciar. \"Disposició següent\" fa servir l'escala "
"que informa el vostre escriptori que en X11 és del 100%."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Scales the text only. Interface Scale above resizes everything -- artwork, "
"spacing and controls -- so use this one when the words are too small rather "
"than the whole interface. It stops at 150% because by then most tile "
"captions are ellipsized and it is the whole interface that needs to be "
"bigger -- which is Interface Scale, above."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Nothing renders smaller than this, whatever Text Size works out to. Raises "
"the smallest labels without enlarging headings, which a percentage cannot do."
msgstr ""

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"\"Default\" changes nothing and lets MPV (and your own mpv.conf) decide. "
"Pick a mode only if you are sending audio to a receiver."
msgstr ""
"\"Per defecte\" no canvia res i permet que MPV (i el seu propi mpv.conf) "
"decideixin. Escolliu un mode només si esteu enviant l'àudio a un receptor."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
"Audio your receiver can't be sent directly is encoded to AC3, which is the "
"only way surround fits down an optical cable. Turn this off if the encoder "
"causes audio delay — those tracks become stereo instead."
msgstr ""
"L'àudio que el vostre receptor no pot rebre directament es codifica com a "
"AC3, que és l'única forma de so envolvent per un cable òptic. Desactiveu-ho "
"si el codificador provoca un retard de l'àudio — aquestes pistes passaran a "
"ser en estèreo."

#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/config.py
msgid ""
